      "cooked": "<p>Does Foresight allow Visionary to switch the die on her card for one rolled for movement during a player's&nbsp;<em>To Be Continued</em>?<br>&nbsp;</p><p>I can see the ruling being that the target is not the one making this roll, so the wording on the card would not apply; however, with the example of The Operative's <em>Dragon's Frenzy&nbsp;</em>specifying attack and defence rolls, I would think the lack of that type of specific wording on Foresight would mean movement (the only other type of roll so far) would also be a roll that can be manipulated.<br><br>Apologies if this has been answered elsewhere, I couldn't find it...</p>",
